# Flagship products

The Developer Place's two strongest products. Lead with these for portfolio, sales strategy, client proposals, demo videos, pricing, website content, and the ₹1 crore growth roadmap.

## 1. ColdFlow — Cold Storage ERP

Complete cold storage management system / ERP.

- Demo: https://cold-storage-five.vercel.app/login
- Positioning: industry ERP for cold storage operations (not a generic "operations module")

## 2. OMNIRETAIL — Fashion / clothing retail

Retail management software focused on **clothing, saree, and fashion brands**.

- Demo: https://omniretail-saree-frontend.vercel.app/login
- Positioning: vertical retail OS for apparel/saree/fashion — not generic "Retail / ERP"

## How to use this

- Treat ColdFlow + OMNIRETAIL as the hero products. Other modules (ecommerce, HR, stock audit, LMS, etc.) are supporting catalog, not equals.
- On the website, proposals, and sales copy: name the products, link the live demos, and speak to their industries (cold storage; clothing/saree/fashion).
- Do not bury them under generic labels like "Retail / ERP" or "Operations" when presenting the company.
